      "totalDuration": "3 yrs",
      "description": "As a Team Lead, I directed the successful rewrite of a large, outdated .NET Framework web application, embracing a cutting-edge tech stack including React, Azure, .NET 10 RESTful API, Axios, RecoilJS, and React-Query. I was able to apply my previous design expertise to assist in making critical UX decisions, enhancing user interactions in the most complex areas of the application.\n\nI cultivated a team culture where every voice was heard, not just leadership. By encouraging innovative, \"outside the box\" thinking, my team was recognized as being high performing, and confident that the work would get done on-time. This inclusive and forward-thinking approach was a key driver of our success.\n\nIn addition to fostering a high-performing team, I pioneered the development of custom AI models to assist with common challenges, significantly boosting our productivity. I also drafted proof of concept AI solutions that enabled the company to swiftly enter the AI space, driving innovation and operational efficiency. This dual focus on team empowerment and technological advancement defined my leadership and contributed to our remarkable achievements.",
